calendar-notifications-modal (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Outlook-style event reminder modal
  * Support for ICS, Microsoft Graph, and Google Calendar backends
  * GTK4-based modal window with dismiss and snooze functionality
  * Systemd user service for automatic startup
  * Auto-generated configuration file

